==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|bez|lang=ru}} < {{proto|Indo-European|bʰeǵʰ-|lang=ru}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-без.ogg|audio}}

===Preposition===
'''без''' (bez, ''+ [[genitive case]]''), [[безо]] (bézo, ''before some awkward consonant clusters'')

# [[without]]
#:* {{Cyrl|без [[вода|воды́]]}} — ''without water''
#:* {{Cyrl|бе́зо [[весь|всего́]]}} — ''without anything''
#:* {{Cyrl|не без [[интерес|интере́са]]}} — ''not without interest''
#:* {{Cyrl|без [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]}} — ''without doubt''
# [[minus]]
#:* {{Cyrl|без [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]}} — ''a quarter to one'' (lit., less a quarter one o’clock)

